    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85914" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποσόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>reckon the quantity of, count,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ψήφους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Char.</u>
					23.6
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ποσω[θεισέων
			δραχμέων</span>] prob.in <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				279.41
			</span></i> (Zeleia, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>); <i>make up a quantity,
				amount to,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hero
			</span></i>
			<i>*Geom.</i><i><span class="en">
				5.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>quantify,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποσῶν τοῦτο τὸ δέκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					6.6.16
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be quantified</i> or <i>quantitatively
				determined,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dam.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				54
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Elias
				<u>in Porph.</u>
				154.35
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ascl.
				<u>in Metaph.</u>
				104.36
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phlp.
			</span></i><i>in de An.</i><i><span class="en">
				543.31
			</span></i>.</div>
